activity-relay-directory (0.1.0~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First pre-1.0 release candidate.
  * Package the Directory daemon with a dedicated system account and private
    state directory, safe loopback/default-off configuration, and hardened
    systemd unit.
  * Keep installation separate from service enablement, startup, reverse-proxy
    exposure, and lifecycle/public-listing activation.

